  "title": "Brown-cheeked rail",
  "extract": "The brown-cheeked rail or eastern water rail is a species of bird in the family Rallidae.\nIt breeds in northern Mongolia, eastern Siberia, northeast China, Korea and northern Japan, and winters in southeast Asia. It used to be considered a subspecies of the water rail.",
